{"symbol":"GAMA.L","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-09T20:09:33Z","info":{"address1":"63 Saint Mary Axe","address2":"3rd Floor","city":"London","zip":"EC3A 8AA","country":"United Kingdom","phone":"44 333 0140000","website":"https://gammagroup.co","industry":"Telecom Services","industryKey":"telecom-services","industryDisp":"Telecom Services","sector":"Communication Services","sectorKey":"communication-services","sectorDisp":"Communication Services","longBusinessSummary":"Gamma Communications plc provides technology-based communications and software services to small, medium, and large-sized organizations in the United Kingdom, rest of Europe, and internationally. The company offers Gamma Enable that enables products and platforms link business and customers to the telephone network; Gamma Connect, which allows businesses to communicate by connecting people through voice, video and chat; Gamma SIP Trunks to connect site's on-premise telephone system directly into the Gamma network through an internet connection to carry and terminate calls across the public telephone network; connectivity and broadband, mobile and FireXchnage, and FUSION IoT solutions; Gamma Connect, a connectivity for voice and data; PhoneLine+, a landline replacement service using VoIP technology to deliver voice calls over the broadband network; CircleLoop, a cloud-based telephony product through web, desktop, and mobile applications; cloud-based communication solutions under the Horizon Cloud Phone System and iPECS names; cloud connect for Webex calling; and Microsoft Teams Phone. It also provides Gamma Experience that blends products and designs enterprise-grade solution; Webex for Gamma; GammaUCX, a voice-integration platform; Amazon Connect, a contact centre platform; Horizon Contact, a cloud-based customer engagement platform; secure payments with PCI compliance; Cirrus Contact Centre, which combines technologies, such as CRM, WFO, analytics, and omni-channel; Gamma Contact for Service Providers, an omnichannel contact center solution; Gamma Secure, a managed cyber security solution; Cyber Maturity Assessment, Vulnerability Management, managed SOP, safeweb, security awareness, and Gamma Managed Detection and Response solutions; Gamma, enterprise managed, managed networks, and Clearing as a service solutions; and Gamma Toolbox, which provides tools and services for businesses. The company was founded in 2002 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","fullTimeEmployees":2000,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Andrew Scott James Belshaw","age":51,"title":"Group CEO & Executive Director","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1172000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Damien Patrick Scott Maltarp","age":51,"title":"CFO & Executive Director","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Colin  Lees","title":"Chief Technology Officer","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Chris  Wade","title":"Chief Marketing & Product Officer","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Chris  Bradford","title":"Chief People Officer","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. David  Macfarlane","age":57,"title":"Chief Executive Officer of Gamma Enterprise","yearBorn":1968,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. John  Murphy","title":"Chief Executive Officer of Gamma Business","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Steve  Holden","title":"Head of Software Development","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Samantha  Russell","title":"Head of Service Provisioning","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Matt  Davies","title":"Head of Customer Programme Management","fiscalYear"